Subject: [PATCH RFC 2/2] arm64: allwinner: a64: Add Brava Keller initial
 support
In-Reply-To: <1512067334-12761-1-git-send-email-jagan@amarulasolutions.com>
References: <1512067334-12761-1-git-send-email-jagan@amarulasolutions.com>
Message-ID: <1512067334-12761-2-git-send-email-jagan@amarulasolutions.com>
To: linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org
List-Id: linux-arm-kernel.lists.infradead.org

Brava Keller is A64 based IoT device, which support
- Allwinner A64 Cortex-A53
- AXP803 PMIC
- 1GB DDR3 RAM
- 8GB eMMC
- Mali-400MP2 GPU
- AP6330 Wifi/BLE
- Camera OV5640
- USB Host and OTG

Signed-off-by: Jagan Teki <jagan@amarulasolutions.com>
---
Note: Need to test it on hardware
 
