 .../boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-a64-brava-keller.dts | 244 +++++++++++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 245 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 arch/arm64/boot/dts/allwinner/sun50i-a64-brava-keller.dts

